q('hcf','Split 16 apples and 24 oranges into as many identical baskets as possible. How many baskets?','8 baskets',['4 baskets','16 baskets','48 baskets'],'Use HCF, because you are making identical groups.',['HCF(16, 24) = 8.','Each basket has 2 apples and 3 oranges.']);
